    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "28f8c8bc-c417-45cc-8041-de06bc0558e7",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "My next ex-husband",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK",
        "PublicId": "108559526821",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 134ad956-8749-42d0-a0d1-a1eebb93e25c).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47 has been contracted to eliminate Jackie Carrington, an actress and former star of the 90s sitcom Picket Defence.\r\rWhile Jackie seems like a industry standard actress with the expected controversies, she has a nickname in the criminal underworld as &quot;The Enchantress&quot;.  The rumor is she has the ability to control any man she has intimate relations with. \r\rYou are to also eliminate her best-friend Molly, who is considered as a one of Jackie&apos;s many &quot;poisons&quot;, and any man she has &quot;enchanted&quot;.",
